  "details": "Description\n\nI am unable to clone my friends’ avatars. Regardless of whether my friend has enabled avatar cloning, the game always displays “This model has cloning disabled.” I am also unable to favorite avatars. There are no issues with my safety settings, and I have already cleared the cache and reinstalled VRChat, but the problem persists. I have not committed any violations of VRChat’s rules. I hope this issue can be resolved as soon as possible.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLog in to VRChat and join a world with a friend.\n\nAsk the friend to enable avatar cloning for their avatar.\n\nOpen the friend's profile  to select \"Clone Avatar\".\n\nThe system incorrectly shows \"This model has cloning disabled\" (此模型已关闭克隆), even though cloning is actually enabled.\n\nTry to click \"Favorite\" on any avatar in the menu. The action fails, and the avatar is not added to the favorites list.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 虚拟形象\n\n- Frequency: 总是\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p2-1938-565822d00a-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-15_01-35-54.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ed81d463-d1bf-4c5b-852f-2db633b8535c/1/file)",
